#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# symmetric_polynomial

#% text
# `symmetric_polynomial(k, xs)` gives the elementary symmetric polynomial of degree `k` in the list `xs`: the sum of the products of all `k`-element subsets.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
symmetric_polynomial(2, [a, b, c])
#% output
#= a*b + a*c + b*c

#% cell
symmetric_polynomial(3, [a, b, c, d])
#% output
#= a*b*c + a*b*d + a*c*d + b*c*d

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `subsets`
